// # 2026-09-11 Polyrepo Sweep — All 13 Repos
//
// Logline: Whole-tree audit of the openOODA polyrepo on 2026-09-11,
//          one day after the 2026-09-10 focused-audit round. File law,
//          structure, cross-reference drift, and zero-trust execution
//          against the installed release binaries (~/.openooda/bin).
//          Priority lane: std/ (26 dirty files). One report, this one;
//          per-repo focused reports where findings warrant.
//
// Setup:  Authored 2026-09-11 by Devin (interactive audit session).
//         Binary-parity note: checks ran on BOTH on-PATH binaries
//         (~/.local/bin, stale 2026-09-09) and the certified set
//         (~/.openooda/bin, 2026-09-11) — see finding C1. Evidence is
//         file:line on disk plus executed probes. Prior-round audits:
//         docs/audit-history/2026-09-10-* and <repo>/audit/.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Per-repo verdict table (13 repos).
//   2. File law results (line cap, headers, extensions, anchors).
//   3. Zero-trust execution (release binary, double-run).
//   4. Binary parity (RULES §1.10 uncommitted amendment).
//   5. Findings by severity (CRITICAL/MAJOR/MINOR/NOTE).
//   6. Cross-references to RULES / prior audits.

