// ## 4. Binary parity (RULES §1.10, uncommitted amendment)

// Two measurements — installer re-ran mid-audit (~05:42-05:44):
//   Run A (~05:40): dist/ooda 9a922dd5… ≠ ~/.openooda/bin/ooda
//     41f2d583… ≠ ~/.local/bin/ooda 23e5c3f0… — three-way divergence.
//   Run B (~05:50): dist/ooda bce47457… == ~/.openooda/bin/ooda
//     bce47457… — dist-vs-installed parity now HOLDS for ooda.
//     ~/.local/bin/ooda still 23e5c3f0… (596,856 B, 2026-09-09) —
//     the stale shadow set was NOT removed by the re-install.
// Residuals after the fix:
//   - ~/.local/bin still shadows: ooda, oodac, ooda-lsp, ooda-mcp,
//     blackbox, opm (all 2026-09-09) — `which -a` resolves them first
//     (~/.local/bin PATH position 1 vs ~/.openooda/bin position 3).
//   - Provenance drift: ~/.openooda/bin/ooda.tmp.sha256 records
//     41f2d583… (the downloaded release) but the file is now
//     bce47457… — a local dist build overwrote the release artifact;
//     the sidecar no longer describes the installed binary.
//   - Re-verified on current binaries: net/ANCHOR.oo check still
//     FAILS (M1 stands); probe_cap_fs rebuild+double-run identical.
// The ci.yml parity gate (ooda/.github/workflows/ci.yml:44-58,113-120)
// checks dist-vs-installed inside CI but cannot see a ~/.local/bin
// shadow — and on this host the shadow is real.

// ## 5. Findings by severity

// CRITICAL (1):
//   C1. Binary Parity Law violated on this host (RULES §1.10
//       uncommitted, §1.21). Post-fix state: dist == installed holds
//       for ooda, but the stale 2026-09-09 toolchain in ~/.local/bin
//       (ooda sha 23e5c3f0… + oodac/lsp/mcp/blackbox/opm) was never
//       removed and still wins PATH resolution — the binary users and
//       PATH-resolving probe suites execute is NOT the certified one.
//       Root cause: installer migration gap — a prior layout installed
//       to ~/.local/bin; current install.sh repairs OODA_COMPILER rc
//       references (install.sh:551-553) but never deletes the files.
//       Detail: install/audit/2026-09-11-focused-install.oot.

// MAJOR (1):
//   M1. std/net/ANCHOR.oo fails `oodac check` on the release binary:
//       `ERR move use after move rest at 83` — root cause
//       std/net/http_resp_parse.oo:81-84 (`let mut val = rest;` moves,
//       then `char_at(rest,0)` and `str_slice(rest,…)` use the moved
//       binding). Committed code, untouched since the 2026-09-02 split.
//       The net/ front door does not typecheck; any file importing it
//       transitively fails. RULES §1.1, §1.4, §1.5.

// MINOR (7):
//   m1. std/net/ANCHOR.oo:122 — `net_mod_tcp_read` still calls
//       net_tcp_read(tcp,fd) with 2 args; the uncommitted tcp.oo diff
//       added required `max_bytes`. Masked today by M1; surfaces when
//       M1 is fixed. Uncommitted-API-change fallout (§1.4).
//   m2. oodac/qa/scratch_lineno.oo — committed scratch file, no Academy
//       header (§1.11, Pillar 10).
//   m3. std/qa/probe_sdl_window.oo — 3-element header, missing Setup:
//       (§1.11).
//   m4. std/qa/probe_repl_direct.tmp.bin — 332KB ELF artifact untracked
//       in qa/, not gitignored (Pillar 10 clean workspace). Suite
//       deletes tmp.bins; this one leaked from a manual run.
//   m5. File:-path drift ×6 — rename residue declaring wrong repo paths:
//       oodac/docs/TOKEN_OPT.oot → "ooda/docs/…";
//       oodac/docs/CAP_LEGACY_SUPERSEDE_REMOVAL_TODO.oot → "openOODA/oodac/…";
//       oodac/bootstrap/seed/{README,SIGNING}.oot → "ooda/bootstrap/…";
//       std/README.oot → "ooda/std/…";
//       openOODA/scripts/moonshot_scorecard.oot → "openOODA/openOODA/…"
//       (double prefix). §1.4 silent drift.
//   m6. std: 6 untracked probes pass but are not wired into qa/suite.oo
//       (probe_repl_direct, probe_repl_m1_audit, probe_repl_m1_test2,
//       probe_sandbox_adv1, probe_sandbox_m1, probe_sandbox_stress) —
//       uncommitted test gates (§1.4). meta/test/{em_gauge,moonshot_score}.oo
//       likewise untracked. Contrast ooda/, where all 12 probes ARE wired.
//   m7. ooda/main.oo:106 — version fallback "v0.2.16" (env-overridable
//       via OODA_VERSION per :35, but the baked default lags the real
//       tag). 2026-09-10 finding n3 restated more precisely (§1.21).

// NOTE (5):
//   n1. Uncommitted 2026-09-10 audit reports sit as ?? in 8 repos
//       (ooda, lsp, mcp, catalog, install, blackbox, website,
//       openOODA/docs/audit-history) — audit trail not yet in git (§1.4).
//   n2. Uncommitted RULES.oot rewrites §1.10 (Binary Parity + Universal
//       QA + `ooda qa` law) and §1.4 — legitimate law evolution, but
//       "The 23 laws below do not change" vs. live amendments is worth
//       an RFC note (§1.13).
//   n3. .github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/{bug_report,feature_request}.oot — YAML
//       frontmatter, no .oot header. GitHub requires the frontmatter;
//       suggest keeping the files but documenting the carve-out in
//       RULES §1.14 alongside the .sh list.
//   n4. oodac/bootstrap/corpus/** (104 .oo) carry no headers and the
//       corpus tree has no ANCHOR.oo — fixtures, but undocumented as
//       such; a one-line corpus/ANCHOR.oo would close the ambiguity.
//   n5. 37 std/qa graphics/SDL probes (cube_3d, ray_3d, sdl_*, …) are
//       not in suite.oo — presumably manual-only (need GPU/SDL); the
//       suite doc-comment says "every probe" which overclaims (§1.4).

